# A Raspberry Pi 4 with 8 GB on Raspberry Pi OS Lite, 64-bit: Debian bookworm on arm64, no screen, no keyring.
DESCRIPTION="Raspberry Pi 4, 8 GB, Raspberry Pi OS Lite (Debian bookworm, arm64)"
PLATFORM=linux/arm64
BASE=debian:bookworm
CPUS=4
MEMORY_MB=8192
# Its four Cortex-A72 cores do about as much as one core of a recent Mac: run.sh --speed caps the container at this
# many of the host's cores, for a rough idea of its speed (a rough one: the cores aren't alike in more than speed).
SPEED_CPUS=1.2
# The apt packages it gets, from deploy/: the list install-pi.sh installs on the real one.
PACKAGES=pi-packages.txt
USER_NAME=pi
